      "typical_award_size": "RFI Round 7 (September 1 to October 1, 2026): most loans $2 million to $5 million, higher considered; construction/bridge up to 36 months interest only; construction to mini-perm 5, 7 or 10 year terms (20 or 30 year amortization); construction to permanent up to 20 years; interest up to 3% during construction and 2% permanent; combined loan to cost up to 95% with subordinate debt; origination fee greater of 1% or $30,000, $15,000 application fee credited at closing, $10,000 conversion fee, 0.15% annual monitoring fee. Fund is up to $150 million from Apple's 2019 $2.5 billion California housing commitment; 4 to 5 projects selected per round.",
