      "layering_notes": "Eligible counties: Alameda, Contra Costa, Marin, Monterey, Napa, San Benito, San Francisco, San Joaquin, San Mateo, Santa Clara, Santa Cruz, Solano and Sonoma. Readiness is the key screen: construction must start by December 31, 2027 and awards are not held past that date. Two proposals per developer. Designed to fill gaps for shovel-ready deals waiting on state awards; repayment from permanent financing including AHSC or Infill Infrastructure Grant proceeds is expected. Full recourse and completion guaranty during construction; first or second deed of trust, subordinate only to a bank construction or permanent lender.",
